  "title": "Update RTPS dissector to support topic alias",
  "description": "This merge request introduces support for the PID related to topic aliases.\nThe following changes have been made:\n- Add PID_TOPIC_NAME_ALIASES with the value 0x8028 to the list of PID definitions.\n- Add static int flags fields (hf_rtps_param_topic_alias_num, hf_rtps_param_topic_alias)\n- Add the string value for the PID\n- Dissect the string sequence for topic alias (rtps_util_add_seq_string)\n- Register the flags under proto_register_rtps",
